he late endosomes to the TGN. May also play a role in transport between the recycling endosomes and the Golgi. Required for maintenance of the Golgi structure, it is involved in the biogenesis of noncentrosomal, Golgi-associated microtubules through recruitment of CLASP1 and CLASP2"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "16885419"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17543864"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "18195106"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "18243103"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19703403"}], "value": "Homodimer. Interacts (via GRIP domain) with RAB6A (preferentially in its GTP-bound form). May interact (RAB6A-dependent) with ARL1; according to PubMed:19703403, RAB6A and ARL1 are not involved in GCC2 Golgi localization as proposed by PubMed:18243103. Interacts (probably via GRIP domain) with RAB9A (preferentially in its GTP-bound form). Interacts with CLASP1 and CLASP2; recruits both proteins to membranes of the TGN. Interacts with STX16"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q8IWJ2", "intActId": "EBI-1645320"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q8IWJ2", "geneName": "GCC2", "intActId": "EBI-1645320"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q8IWJ2", "intActId": "EBI-1645320"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P20340", "geneName": "RAB6A", "intActId": "EBI-1052826"}, "numberOfExperiments": 4, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"value": "Cytoplasm", "id": "SL-0086"}}, {"location": {"value": "Golgi apparatus, trans-Golgi network membrane", "id": "SL-0267"}, "topology": {"value": "Peripheral membrane protein", "id": "SL-9903"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTE